{"overview":"سانکار همیشه و ناره همیشه برای عشق آرزو داشتند. وقتی در کودکی همدیگر را می‌دیدند و عاشق می‌شدند، می‌دانستند که برای هم‌ساز هستند؛ فقط باید صبر می‌کردند تا سن ازدواج را برسند. در شب عروسی‌شان، کشف شگفت‌انگیزی توسط ناره زندگی‌شان را برای همیشه تغییر می‌دهد و عشق‌شان را تا شب عروسی دیگری که سال‌ها بعد اتفاق می‌افتد، متوقف می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Sancar has always & Nare has always yearned for love. When they meet and fall in love as children, they know they are meant to be; they just have to wait to be old enough to marry. On the night of their wedding, a startling revelation by Nare forever changes their lives and puts their love on hold until the night of another wedding many years later.","tagline_en":"","runtime":120,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":17,"y":2019,"poster":"/6Qg8uiHkbK26X6TAfrCRkb46c38.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":35,"y":2020,"poster":"/91gn1lpGhbeS3vgb9F6IRq7TXGo.jpg"}],"episodes":52,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Engin Akyürek","role":"Sancar Efeoğlu","photo":"/oynWT3byuD2t6DUaCkS9dr84cqQ.jpg"},{"name":"Tuba Büyüküstün","role":"Mavi Çınar","photo":"/14QRLZqXAZglMB7Z25uXg6IG3LG.jpg"},{"name":"Erdal Küçükkömürcü","role":"Güven Çelebi","photo":"/o6RkaL1WFEvfAkSF641ebYiopZX.jpg"},{"name":"Gonca Cilasun","role":"Halise Efeoğlu","photo":"/99kch2UqLzdgavqJThOwsCOoQCL.jpg"},{"name":"Doğukan Polat","role":"Yahya Efeoğlu","photo":"/t4yj8yQjn0ygqZaIglmhT4OTgmJ.jpg"},{"name":"Hivda Zizan Alp","role":"Elvan Efeoğlu","photo":"/rbuO2JNHfu1pjsBStUIbXZdEUbh.jpg"},{"name":"Edip Tepeli","role":"Kavruk Ömer","photo":"/sbH9x2RkFOC8N0qKYNG6kAfbdBX.jpg"},{"name":"Beren Gençalp","role":"Melek Efeoğlu","photo":"/dpT6V4ex4BZSgQF24ovIlURK3yd.jpg"},{"name":"Ferit Aktuğ","role":"Bora","photo":"/txZkWJki9quXGGrCEOiorfk9xPO.jpg"},{"name":"Cemre Öktem","role":"Zehra Efeoğlu","photo":"/cVpVgShR9UBR1K1JYk7HAWcEeu1.jpg"},{"name":"Esra Kızıldoğan","role":"Müge Işıklı","photo":"/6ovR6bdjB8chm2zbxNyU9qyoP03.